{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style></style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">히노끼 루바(무절)은 편백나무로 잘 알려져 있으며 일본에서</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">식재되는 상록 교목입니다. 물에 강해 사우나재로도 쓰이고 있으며,</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">피톤치드 발산량이 많아 특유의 향을 갖고 있는 것이 특징입니다.</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">나뭇결이 조밀하고 광택이 있으며, 고급바닥재나 창호 욕조로 쓰입니다.</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\"><strong><u>· 규격</u></strong></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">10T x 100 x 2400 (8자)</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\">무절 원목은 별도 문의</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\"></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic;font-size: 11pt\"><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"07189e7234c949c366a171c75f42ddae_173655.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/07189e7234c949c366a171c75f42ddae_173655.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"8b72577d971d58a8b75822a1c8955c79_173656.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/8b72577d971d58a8b75822a1c8955c79_173656.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"55ab103996c6a1c5dd3c46e6ca8d2f94_173656.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/55ab103996c6a1c5dd3c46e6ca8d2f94_173656.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"29046d78a90a6385e0db61f4212c7fb0_173657.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/29046d78a90a6385e0db61f4212c7fb0_173657.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"5823ae6d4299c72b9208421ffc680acc_173658.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/5823ae6d4299c72b9208421ffc680acc_173658.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /></span></p></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}